{"series":{"id":"bking","slug":"bking","title":"B.King","image":"https://donghualife.com/images/webp/bking-1__coverImage.webp","synopsis":"(Spirit Master / B.King)Tras alcanzar la fama con su cómic 驭灵师 (Spirit Master), un autor en decadencia comienza a sacrificar a sus personajes para recuperar audiencia. De forma inesperada, es absorbido por su propia obra y reencarna en el cuerpo de Wang Xiaoming. Ahora, con la mentalidad del creador y conociendo cada secreto de la trama, deberá navegar el peligroso mundo que él mismo diseñó, utilizando sus conocimientos privilegiados para tomar un atajo divino y alcanzar el poder absoluto. Estudio: UKA (Una bruja sin cerebro) Estreno: 26_02_2026","genres":["Isekai","Comedia","Fantasía","Acción"],"sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/series/bking","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:39:33.921Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"bking-1","slug":"bking-1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/bking-1-1","image":null,"number":1,"seriesId":"bking","firstEpisodeUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/bking-1-1","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:39:43.156Z","episodeCount":18,"minEpisodeFound":1,"maxEpisodeFound":18,"missingEpisodes":[],"paginationComplete":true,"initialSyncComplete":true}],"episodes":[{"id":"bking-1-1","slug":"bking-1-1","title":"B.King - 1 Episodio x1","sourceUrl":"https://old.donghualife.com/episode/bking-1-episodio-x1","servers":[{"name":"rumble","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v748sf4/?pub=4m2typ","embed":true},{"name":"Dailymotion","url":"https://geo.dailymotion.com/player.html?video=k4UU17PAav0QKeF1CLm","embed":true},{"name":"Dailymotion","url":"https://old.donghualife.com/episode/Dailymotion","embed":true},{"name":"rumble.com","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v748sf4/?pub=4m2typ","embed":true},{"name":"geo.dailymotion.com","url":"https://geo.dailymotion.com/player.html?video=k4UU17PAav0QKeF1CLm","embed":true}],"previousUrl":null,"nextUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/bking-1-2","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T23:02:49.366Z","seriesId":"bking","season